  "id": "brooklyn-style-brick-oven-pizza",
  "name": "Brooklyn-Style Brick-Oven Pizza",
  "subtitle": "Thin-crust pizza with mozzarella, tomato, oregano, and basil",
  "description": "A crisp, thin American-style pizza made with an overnight dough, simple tomato topping, and fresh basil.",
